<title>USA: Aon Consulting acquires Canadian firm.</title>
<headline>Aon Consulting acquires Canadian firm.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aon Consulting Worldwide, a unit of Aon Corp, said Monday it has acquired Martineau, Provencher &amp; Associates Ltd, an actuarial, benefits and human resources consulting firm in Canada.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Martineau, Provencher was founded more than 20 years ago and has offices in Montreal, Toronto and Quebec City.</p>
<p>Aon Corp is a holding company including insurance brokerage, consulting and insurance underwriting subsidiaries.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
